  event_token: fdbf1b03-1706-4ff8-8c3b-dbfa52a56e78
}

docs {
  Company flow: create a `brand_kits` row, preview it inline, upload a logo,
  save the kit's overrides, then assign the saved kit to an existing event
  with no preset involved — `PATCH /events/:id { brandKitId }`.

  `event_id` / `event_token` above default to a real event seeded in the
  `local` environment, same as `party/folder.bru`. Override with a real
  event you own (`GET /events`).

  Steps:
    01 - create brand kit                        sets brand_kit_id
    02 - preview inline kit (colors + socialCta)  dry run, no persistence
    03 - create upload url (brand kit logo) [manual]  real Supabase target
    04 - put logo file (signed url) [manual]          needs Bruno Dev Mode
    05 - patch brand kit overrides                persists tokens/logo/socialCta
    06 - preview with brandKitId                  dry run using the saved kit
    07 - patch event (brand kit, no preset)        assigns the kit to an event
    08 - get public event theme (verify)           public, 5 min cache

  Create the kit FIRST (key + name only), THEN upload its logo — the upload
  URL needs an existing `ownerId`. Inline preview kits (step 02) are for
  colors/socialCta feedback only; they have no id and cannot receive an
  uploaded image.
}
